1
00:01:07,599 --> 00:01:08,200
I have to say,

2
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:10,359
Lijia Town's streets are quite lively.

3
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,079
I'll take a newspaper.

4
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,560
Bro Xun, pay him.

5
00:01:22,159 --> 00:01:23,799
Lijia Gold Shop really got robbed. Stop!

6
00:01:24,879 --> 00:01:25,200
Stop right there!

7
00:01:28,359 --> 00:01:28,840
Hand it over!

8
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:31,560
Take him away.

9
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:32,400
Yes, Inspector.

10
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:35,400
Don't move!

11
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:35,879
A female inspector?

12
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:38,519
Why is it you guys again?

13
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:41,840
See for yourself.

14
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:47,400
Lijia Gold Shop.

15
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:49,400
The Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth?

16
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:51,359
Lijia Gold Shop was robbed last night.

17
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,200
Don't tell me you didn't know.

18
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,239
Don't even mention it.

19
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,439
That night watchman last night

20
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,680
died before finishing his sentence.

21
00:01:59,159 --> 00:02:00,280
The archer also got away.

22
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:03,519
In just one night,

23
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,239
how did Lijia Gold Shop get robbed?

24
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:07,599
The King of Hell's Wedding

25
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,039
was a smokescreen to begin with.

26
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,280
Its real target

27
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:13,080
was the Lijia Gold Shop.

28
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:17,280
How did you find more clues?

29
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:17,960
Let's hear it.

30
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:22,520
Wait.

31
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,159
Inspector Mu!

32
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:29,360
Something terrible happened!

33
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:30,000
Let's go, let's go!

34
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,919
The door has a special Linglong Lock.

35
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:40,960
The key isn't missing.

36
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,280
These windows

37
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:44,039
were locked from the inside.

38
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,400
Every two hours at night,

39
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:46,599
someone patrols the area.

40
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:48,639
But despite all the precautions,

41
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,439
we can guard against humans,

42
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,840
but we can't guard against ghosts!

43
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,840
The Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth

44
00:02:53,039 --> 00:02:54,120
carried away all the gold

45
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:55,719
from the shop!

46
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:56,439
Nonsense!

47
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:58,719
It was clearly a robbery by thieves.

48
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,400
Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth? Nonsense!

49
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:01,840
Inspector,

50
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:03,360
it was the Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth!

51
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,919
When I was patrolling last night,

52
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,400
I saw it with my own eyes.

53
00:03:24,759 --> 00:03:25,759
It wasn't until dawn

54
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:27,000
that I finally woke up,

55
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,159
only to find the gold in the shop

56
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,719
had already been

57
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,400
cleared out by the Five Ghosts.

58
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,080
What's going on?

59
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,120
Was it really the Five Ghosts?

60
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:46,960
These flimsy paper-mache things...

61
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,159
You call these the Five Ghosts?

62
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,439
They can carry wealth?

63
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,199
It's absolutely true!

64
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,159
Master,

65
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:55,919
this place is way too creepy.

66
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,759
Let's get out of here.

67
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,199
Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth...

68
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,560
This yellow powder on their faces is

69
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,759
Linglong Lock.

70
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,879
You saw the Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth?

71
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:40,160
What did your Five-Sense Deduction find?

72
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:47,759
What's this?

73
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,680
Datura powder.

74
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,319
Datura powder?

75
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:53,959
Exactly.

76
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,800
Does this have anything to do

77
00:05:55,879 --> 00:05:56,519
with the Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth?

78
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,160
The servant on patrol last night

79
00:05:59,279 --> 00:06:00,319
saw someone pushing a cart.

80
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:02,360
It held five paper figures.

81
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:03,759
The paper figures

82
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:06,319
were covered in this Datura powder.

83
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:25,439
The servant inhaled it and hallucinated.

84
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:28,399
Fooled by Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth,

85
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:31,439
he saw thieves disguised as Five Ghosts.

86
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:33,199
And these five paper figures

87
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,120
are nothing but

88
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:37,879
a trick by the thieves to deceive people.

89
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,680
I knew it.

90
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,360
There are no ghosts.

91
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:42,480
It must have been the thieves.

92
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,439
So the Five Ghosts were a hallucination.

93
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,240
But the doors and windows were locked.

94
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:48,560
The lock on the gold shop

95
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,160
is an anti-theft Linglong Lock.

96
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,000
The so-called Linglong Lock

97
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:56,319
is nothing more than an ordinary lock.

98
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,800
Swindlers renamed it to raise the price,

99
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:02,600
just to scam money from wealthy families.

100
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:05,439
Then after the thieves pried open the gold shop,

101
00:07:05,879 --> 00:07:06,519
what happened next?

102
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:09,240
Follow me.

103
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,519
Judging from the wheel tracks,

104
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,560
they must have pushed three carts

105
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:20,560
to transport the gold away.

106
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:22,360
Where did they take it?

107
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:27,319
To the east of Lijia Town are mountains.

108
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,120
Wooden wheels on mountain roads

109
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,399
would be very bumpy

110
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,399
and slow to push.

111
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:33,160
I'm absolutely certain

112
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,360
that they headed west.

113
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,839
To the Lijia River Dock.

114
00:07:37,839 --> 00:07:38,720
They went by water.

115
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,480
Lijia River Dock.

116
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,639
Alright, I'll go now.

117
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:44,680
Thank you.

118
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:48,279
Look for the boat with the deepest draft.

119
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,439
Got it.

120
00:07:59,399 --> 00:08:00,160
So the story goes,

121
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:04,120
My master uses his Five-Sense Deduction

122
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,439
Just recently,

123
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,839
he walked around the Lijia Gold Shop,

124
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,639
and perfectly reconstructed

125
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:12,120
the truth of the Lijia Gold Shop theft.

126
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:13,360
It turns out

127
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,319
the night watchman

128
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:15,879
was a scout for the gang of thieves.

129
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,800
They poisoned wealthy families' brides,

130
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:19,839
then posed as the King of Hell

131
00:08:19,959 --> 00:08:21,120
to steal the brides' corpses.

132
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:21,920
They even spread rumors

133
00:08:22,079 --> 00:08:23,439
about the King of Hell's Wedding

134
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:25,040
to distract the police.

135
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:25,959
In reality,

136
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,480
what they truly wanted to steal

137
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:29,879
was the richest man Benefactor Li's shop.

138
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,439
But all these criminal tricks

139
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:34,679
my master saw right through them!

140
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:35,159
Bravo!

141
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:35,639
Bravo!

142
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:36,200
Bravo!

143
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:37,639
Sir.

144
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:40,320
I'm Mengzhu, heiress to Lijia Gold Shop.

145
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:41,799
May I ask, sir,

146
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,960
how do you know about our shop's theft?

147
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,799
Would you honor us with a visit?

148
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:50,399
My apprentice and I are both hungry.

149
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:51,679
We need to go eat.

150
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,480
Come eat at my house.

151
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:55,399
I'll tell our chef

152
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:57,080
to cook an Imperial Feast for you.

153
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,080
Thank you for your kindness, Miss,

154
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:02,200
but I am just a commoner.

155
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,799
It's inappropriate for me to visit.

156
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:05,759
Farewell.

157
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:06,879
Let's go.

158
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:08,759
Miss.

159
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,600
What a clueless bookworm.

160
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:11,559
Let's ignore him.

161
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:12,720
Let's take a stroll at the Temple Fair.

162
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:20,080
Little trinkets!

163
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,120
This umbrella is pretty.

164
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:21,840
It is.

165
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,320
Right?

166
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,720
How much is this?

167
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:26,720
How about...

168
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:32,879
Miss! Miss!

169
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:33,799
Come look at this!

170
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:35,799
Miss,

171
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:36,639
what would you like?

172
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,000
This puppet...

173
00:09:38,159 --> 00:09:40,120
Does it resemble our Zhong Kui painting?

174
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,240
Father hung a Zhong Kui painting at home,

175
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,720
to catch ghosts and ward off evil.

176
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:47,879
Excuse me, I'll take this.

177
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:49,799
Miss, you have great taste.

178
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:51,639
This was blessed at the temple.

179
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:54,279
It wards off evil and keeps you safe!

180
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:03,639
Dad!

181
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:05,720
Dad!

182
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:09,559
Dad!

183
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:14,080
Dad!

184
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:15,879
Dad!

185
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,639
I bought you something good.

186
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:18,679
What is it?

187
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,320
Come with me and you'll see.

188
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:25,080
Dad, listen to this.

189
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,480
The gold stolen from the gold shop...

190
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,919
...has all been recovered.

191
00:10:28,519 --> 00:10:30,679
Now I've bought this Zhong Kui...

192
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,200
...to guard your door and keep you safe.

193
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:35,360
You won't have to fear the dead concubines

194
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,279
...coming to haunt you anymore.

195
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,879
This mansion is haunted.

196
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:41,879
Keep your voice down.

197
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,120
Don't let them hear you.

198
00:11:03,519 --> 00:11:04,159
Master!

199
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,200
Master! Master!

200
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:06,840
Master!

201
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:07,679
Madam!

202
00:11:07,799 --> 00:11:08,440
Master! Madam!

203
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,639
Master!

204
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,080
Master!

205
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,240
Master! Master!

206
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:13,799
Master!

207
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:16,840
Master!

208
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:30,799
Dad!

209
00:11:31,039 --> 00:11:32,639
I want to swap rooms with you.

210
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,840
There's a cat outside my room.

211
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,279
It's been making noise all night.

212
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,679
Mengzhu.

213
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:41,279
A cat bit you when you were little.

214
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:43,600
Why are you still so afraid of cats?

215
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,159
I don't care.

216
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:46,679
I want to swap rooms with you.

217
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:47,440
Dad!

218
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,440
Alright, alright, alright.

219
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,120
Alright.

220
00:11:56,399 --> 00:11:57,360
Oh, you...
